msgid ""
"The ``OpenXRExtensionWrapper`` type is intended to be subclassed from "
"GDExtensions. The method ``_set_instance_create_info_and_get_next_pointer`` "
"has a ``void*`` parameter so it's not exposed to scripting."
msgstr ""
"``OpenXRExtensionWrapper`` 类型旨在从 GDExtensions 中细分为子类。方法 "
"``_set_instance_create_info_and_get_next_pointer`` 有一个 ``void*`` 参数，所"
"以不会暴露在脚本中。"

